						base acute, 
						margin coarsely crenate-dentate; 
						secondary veins 1-3 pairs; 

					the smaller leaf of a pair with the petiole 0.1-0.2 cm long and the blade broadly ovate to ovate, 0.5-1.8 x 0.4-1.3 cm, unequal-sided, 
						apex obtuse to rounded, 
						base subcordate to rounded; 
						secondary veins 1-2 pairs.

Leaves of a pair unequal; 
